1/4] > 0 is the vector mass index, not mA/H. The default grid reproduces the \
old range 0.01 <= nu <= 1. The physical mass is Sqrt[nu^2+1/4]. Overall \
couplings, diagram multiplicities and momentum factors retain the original \
notebook conventions; this optimization does not perform a new normalization \
audit.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "37747d59-7326-8744-8fff-f03236125913"],
