  Cell["Explicit finite coefficients for Appendices A.3.2 and A.4.2",
   "Section"], Cell["The finite hard coefficients are reduced to four exact \
hypergeometric functions (three include parameter derivatives). No regulator \
limit remains in these formulas. FullSimplify and FunctionExpand are \
attempted below; the remaining special functions are retained exactly. The \
five box coefficients are then simplified together, with all P symbols \
substituted.", "Text"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[
    {Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"BeginPackage", "[", "\"GaugeBosonSignal`\"\
", "]"}], ";"}]], "Input"]}, Open]],
